## Tech Stack

- **Expo 56** (managed workflow)
- **React Native 0.85** + **React 19**
- **TypeScript** 6.0
- **React Navigation 7** (Stack + Bottom Tabs)
- **react-native-paper** 5 — Material Design 3 components
